WEBVTT

NOTE
Deling City parade sequence — approach to the ceremonial plaza.
Duration: approximately 28 seconds.

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.000
A bright flash fills the screen.

00:00:03.000 --> 00:00:06.000
The parade route through Deling City.

00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:09.000
Aerial view of Edea's golden circular parade float from above, slowly rotating.

00:00:09.000 --> 00:00:12.000
Edea's float turns, its gold and teal mechanics glinting in the light.

00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:15.000
The parade continues through the ceremonial streets.

00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:18.000
Crowds and decorations line the parade route.

00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:21.000
Approaching the great Deling City arch — ornate stonework framing the ceremonial gate.

00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:24.000
The ornate dark arch facade with gargoyle columns and amber light ahead.

00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:28.000
The ceremonial arch fills the frame as the parade reaches its destination.
